{"version":1,"key":"card:635","content":{"id":635,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"eea06263-2a63-408a-809c-e29a7e64920e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为什么节食不行：我们的身体通过代谢率来控制输出，当节食时大脑会以为进入了饥荒状态，会降低代谢率，导致疲劳，烦躁，当恢复饮食时会迅速反弹。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4820e479-042d-46c5-8c50-0252e6cedfed","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"影响因素："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"1f2fac4b-a960-45f6-a7ac-cd7541e4e072","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"78194074-23d9-41ec-a346-344223072644","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8e3edb8d-e71a-47d0-b245-e3fbe73743c9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"果糖，不是指水果中和纤维混在一起的糖，而是指人工加工的果糖，果糖不像葡萄糖可以被细胞利用，果糖的代谢路径只有被肝脏转化为脂肪"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"adf8a1b3-e80a-4175-8454-1ced3769b166","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"60f39c99-fbc9-463e-9e8c-f738cad988c7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"瘦素抵抗，瘦素是脂肪细胞分泌的激素，告诉大脑已经够了，不必再吃了，但是超重的人会分泌大量瘦素，导致大脑无法处理这么多瘦素，导致瘦素抵抗，机制失灵，反而会让我们产生饥饿感，疯狂的吃东西"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"3816bd20-f74f-4f4d-bb9a-c69bca9cfd48","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3e46f4c0-4ec4-4bda-bda3-f5dbc49facd3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"胰岛素风暴，当我们吃下大量碳水时（白米饭、白面等），血糖水平迅速升高，会刺激我们的胰腺分泌胰岛素，胰岛素会促使这个葡萄糖进入细胞被分解利用，而无法被分解的就会被转化为脂肪存储，由于产生的大量胰岛素会导致血糖迅速下降，会重新产生饥饿感，而且会伴随着大量葡萄糖转化为脂肪"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"783803a1-4099-4a5b-ab6f-2881b36e8e98","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2c9ec001-47a0-4957-9690-8aa39e9475f2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"压力，在远古时期，外部压力会导致我们生成皮质醇激素，这种激素会促使我们战斗和逃跑，但是在现代，我们压力来自于KPI、领导、房贷等，持续的皮质醇水平会让你倾向于高热量食物，并且更倾向于把脂肪存储在腹部"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"041eb12d-66c6-49ed-859a-42763163c4e7","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"394b1e5c-41ac-4f23-aab4-49eaa14ce2c7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"睡眠，睡眠不足会导致体内饥饿素飙升，瘦素水平下降"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8973a2dd-a663-4f06-a57a-8e557bd2d0a3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解决办法：发送正确信号给大脑，我们现在的环境很安全，不需要这么多脂肪了。"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"39a0b94e-79b1-47a0-a6fa-2172df9fa7bb","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"cef79db9-50e6-4dcc-94b4-aae67260a620","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c300de12-4f10-4510-a9f5-e172acaa6795","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"饮食习惯，减少加工食物（糖，精致碳水）的摄入"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"8c84ee73-7549-